      161.85,
      331.49,
      401.87,
      366.23
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 161 of the Intellectual Property Act, No. 36 of2003 is hereby amended by the insertion immediately aftersubsection (4) thereof, the following new subsection:\u2014",
